OL,3,GNEWSAIndie band celebrates album's top
OL,4,A10 chart success
OL,5,
OL,6,FA band's new album that features "nods"
OL,7,Fto the guitarist and singer's hometown,
OL,8,FPortsmouth, has reached the top 10 in
OL,9,Fthe Official Charts in several
OL,10,Fcategories.
OL,12,FThe Howlers reached number two in the
OL,13,Falbum downloads chart, number three in
OL,14,Fthe independent album breakers chart
OL,15,Fand number 10 in the independent album
OL,16,Fchart with their new album 'Heavy'.
OL,18,FIt comes after the band's debut album
OL,19,F'What You've Got to Lose to Win It All'
OL,20,Freached number 10 in the record store
OL,21,Fchart.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
