OL,3,GNEWSAIndie band celebrates album's top
OL,4,A10 chart success
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuitarist and singer Adam Young said:
OL,7,F"In one of the busiest release weeks of
OL,8,Fthe year going up against some huge
OL,9,Fartists I'm so proud of how hard our
OL,10,Fwhole team worked to hold our own."
